{"study_id": "zk26_lgbm_defaults_20261106_haiku_v3", "search_seed": 42, "factor_id": "725f95919105f4cae61971a009d024f08c5193b979ec9abec05757200964cf10", "expression": "CS_DEMEAN($zk_iliq)", "canonical_expression": {"op": "CS_DEMEAN", "args": [{"op": "field", "args": [], "value": "zk_iliq"}], "value": null}, "description": "Products that are illiquid relative to their peers on the monthly Amivest inverse liquidity state zk_iliq earn a liquidity compensation premium that is realized over the next 12 five-minute bars. Cross-sectionally demeaned zk_iliq should therefore predict the 12-bar forward log return of adj_close positively across products.", "direction": -1, "origins": [{"source": "v3_async", "trial": 125, "attempt": 125, "run_id": "futures_kernel_5m_full-all-fold2-v3_async-42-61c42b9f7c"}]}
{"study_id": "zk26_lgbm_defaults_20261106_haiku_v3", "search_seed": 42, "factor_id": "66e93e5bc849bbca9a70ad8f0c770204c3763a4c6753bab07beef95bedb81d31", "expression": "MULTIPLY(SIGN(SUBTRACT(LOG($adj_close@1d), LOG(DELAY($adj_close@1d, 1.0)))), DIVIDE(SUBTRACT(LOG($adj_high@1d), LOG($adj_low@1d)), DELAY(TS_MEAN(SUBTRACT(LOG($adj_high@1d), LOG($adj_low@1d)), 20.0), 1.0)))", "canonical_expression": {"op": "MULTIPLY", "args": [{"op": "SIGN", "args": [{"op": "SUBTRACT", "args": [{"op": "LOG", "args": [{"op": "field", "args": [], "value": "adj_close@1d"}], "value": null}, {"op": "LOG", "args": [{"op": "DELAY", "args": [{"op": "field", "args": [], "value": "adj_close@1d"}, {"op": "const", "args": [], "value": 1.0}], "value": null}], "value": null}], "value": null}], "value": null}, {"op": "DIVIDE", "args": [{"op": "SUBTRACT", "args": [{"op": "LOG", "args": [{"op": "field", "args": [], "value": "adj_high@1d"}], "value": null}, {"op": "LOG", "args": [{"op": "field", "args": [], "value": "adj_low@1d"}], "value": null}], "value": null}, {"op": "DELAY", "args": [{"op": "TS_MEAN", "args": [{"op": "SUBTRACT", "args": [{"op": "LOG", "args": [{"op": "field", "args": [], "value": "adj_high@1d"}], "value": null}, {"op": "LOG", "args": [{"op": "field", "args": [], "value": "adj_low@1d"}], "value": null}], "value": null}, {"op": "const", "args": [], "value": 20.0}], "value": null}, {"op": "const", "args": [], "value": 1.0}], "value": null}], "value": null}], "value": null}, "description": "A daily session whose high-low range exceeds its trailing 20-session average, signed by the session's close-to-close direction, carries the next hour's 5m log-return direction. Expansion without a clear direction carries no signal. The expansion ratio is the state variable, so the signed product should beat both the sign-only and expansion-only controls on train and validation.", "direction": -1, "origins": [{"source": "v3_async", "trial": 129, "attempt": 129, "run_id": "futures_kernel_5m_full-all-f